  "commit": {
   "author": {
    "date": "2026-08-28T02:33:36Z",
    "email": "kwildfeuer@me.com",
    "name": "Kody Wildfeuer"
   },
   "comment_count": 0,
   "committer": {
    "date": "2026-08-28T02:33:36Z",
    "email": "kwildfeuer@me.com",
    "name": "Kody Wildfeuer"
   },
   "message": "pages: Article XXIV \u2014 zero unauthenticated api.github.com reads\n\nclassic.html and doorman/index.html made 11 unauthenticated api.github.com\ncalls per visitor: this seed's own repo metadata / recent commits /\nagents/ listing (egg-sealing, fillAgents, fillMutations, _forkCount,\n_customAgentCount, the doorman's public-agents inventory, the ascended-egg\nexporter's origin commit), plus the same three signals for a seed's\nparent_repo to compute the lineage MMR gift. Each now reads a CI-harvested\nstate/*_snapshot.json committed here, in the identical shape the replaced\nAPI endpoint returns, via scripts/harvest_gh_snapshots.py (initial harvest\nincluded) and a daily/on-push workflow.\n\nThe private_companion agents lookup in doorman/index.html stays a live,\nauthenticated fetch \u2014 its repo may be access-gated and can't be\npre-published. Login and Issues-as-API writes (memory sync, private\nmemories) are untouched: they require a token and are exempt.\n\nindex.html carries no violations and is untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
