   "message": "Migrate to RAPP/1: coordinated identity re-anchor + schema label (identity layer)\n\nDeterministic re-anchor of each rappid from its own UUID to the domain-tagged 64-hex mint (\u00a75/\u00a76.2); old string kept in _migrated_from (\u00a76.3); schema label -> rapp/1 (\u00a712); parent_rappid rewired to the new estate ids in one coordinated pass. Content-addressed frames and test fixtures untouched. Frame re-genesis is the owner-signed pass 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
